			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Manual §6: Tools]"
				""
				"Tools are crafting ingredients that lose durability: hammer (plates), wrench (casings, machines), file, saw,"
				"screwdriver, wire cutter, knife and mortar. Keep a full set in your toolbelt."
